# Shapers' Sanctuary: Bot2's Lightning Bolts on Bot1's two Ornithopters each trigger it (CR 115.1, 603.2c); the first
# is accepted (a card is drawn, before the Bolt resolves, so the Ornithopter then dies), the second declined (nothing
# drawn): "you may". The draw is before the bolt resolves (the 2017 ruling), shown by the Stack still holding the Bolt.
# Bot1's hand is three Forests once its spells are cast, so the hand count is the draws.

